# Test_House

// Conversations of the house interior test scene.

[house_intro | forced]
// Continues the cutscene of Test_Movement after the scene change (started by "@scene Test_House door house_intro").
@face Player north
> A new scene: the previous cutscene continued right where it stopped.
@move Player 0 -2
@wait 0.3
> Walk back to the door at the bottom of the room to leave.
